Sideloaded Application
# The report names androdr-113 only on the flagged app's own "Reasons" line (the raw
# telemetry lists every component name, so the names themselves cannot be forbidden).
# This app's Reasons line must end without it. Exact when this scenario runs alone or
# with bright_sdk_proxyware; weaker when other hidden sideloaded fixtures are loaded.
~Reasons : Sideloaded Application; Hidden App \(No Launcher Icon\)$
